      "id": "5f651b5a-07e4-4810-986e-a43d91cf4f4e",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -608,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## Cross-post new RSS articles to X, LinkedIn and Facebook\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Triggers on a schedule to check RSS feeds.\n2. Configures RSS cross-posting with feed details.\n3. Validates configuration and reads from enabled RSS feeds.\n4. Processes and normalizes articles for distribution.\n5. Routes articles to designated social media channels and publishes them.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Ensure RSS feed URLs are up-to-date and publicly accessible.\n- [ ] Configure database access for ledger operations.\n- [ ] Enter credentials for X, LinkedIn, and Facebook accounts.\n- [ ] Adjust schedule as per posting frequency needs.\n\n### Customization\n\nFeed URLs, social media channels, and posting frequency can be customized within the setup nodes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
